---
import CommunityLayout from '../../layouts/CommunityLayout.astro';
---
<CommunityLayout title="相亲帖">
  <article data-view="detail" class="post-detail community-shell"><div class="community-main">
    <a href="/meet" class="community-back" data-astro-reload>返回相亲广场</a>
    <p id="community-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="community-message">正在加载帖子…</p>
    <div id="post-detail"></div>
    <section id="contact-section" class="contact-box" hidden>
      <h2>联系方式 <small>CONTACT</small></h2>
      <div class="contact-row"><p id="post-contact"></p><button type="button" id="copy-contact" class="community-button secondary">复制</button></div>
    </section>
    </div><aside class="community-side"><section id="poster-section" hidden><h2>发帖人 / POSTER</h2><div class="poster"><span id="post-avatar" class="poster-avatar" aria-hidden="true"></span><p id="post-author" class="poster-name"></p></div></section><section><h2>照片 / PHOTO</h2><div id="post-photos"></div></section><section><h2>安全提示 / SAFETY</h2><div class="community-note community-aside-note"><ol><li>首次见面请选择公共场所，并告知朋友行程。</li><li>不转账，不借钱，不轻信投资推荐。</li><li>对方急于把你拉到其他平台，请多留心。</li></ol></div><p class="community-note side-links" id="report-post" hidden><a href="mailto:hi@amazingindex.com">举报此帖</a></p></section></aside>
  </article>
</CommunityLayout>
